But then they play it longer that you actually realize that it's built to to to make you feel like it's in it's tennis.

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:11.640
Yeah, I agree. I think this game felt a lot more natural than NES tennis.

00:15:13.060 --> 00:15:25.620
